{{also|पुर|पुरु|पुर्|पूर|पेरू|पैर}}
==Hindi==

===Pronunciation===
* {{hi-IPA}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|hi|psu|𑀧𑀭𑀺}}, {{m|psu|𑀉𑀧𑁆𑀧𑀭𑀺}}, from {{inh|hi|sa|उपरि||[[above]]}}.<ref>{{cite-book|chapter=The diverse origins of the Hindi simple postpositions|title=Grammaticalization and the Rise of Configurationality in Indo-Aryan|last=Reinöhl|first=Uta|year=2016|isbn=9780198736660}}</ref>

====Postposition====
{{hi-post|tr=par|ur=پر}}

# [[on]]
#: {{hi-x|सड़क पर|on the road}}
#: {{hi-x|मेज़ पर|on the table}}
# [[at]]
#: {{hi-x|घर पर|at home}}
#: {{syn|hi|पे}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|hi|psu|𑀧𑀭𑀁}}, from {{der|hi|sa|परम्||after, but}}, oblique of {{m|sa|पर||distant, further}}.

====Conjunction====
{{hi-con|tr=par|ur=پر}}

# [[but]], [[however]]
#: {{hi-x|मैंने दूध पिया, '''पर''' मैंने नाश्ता नहीं किया।|I drank milk, '''however''' I did not have breakfast.}}
# [[nevertheless]]

=====Synonyms=====
* {{l|hi|मगर}}
* {{l|hi|लेकिन}}
* {{l|hi|किन्तु}}

===Etymology 3===
Borrowed from {{bor|hi|fa|پر|tr=par}}.

====Noun====
{{hi-noun|g=m|ur=پر}}

# [[feather]]; [[wing]]
#: {{syn|hi|पंख}}
# [[quill]]

